{
  "id": "support_reactions___equilibrium",
  "title": "Support Reactions - Equilibrium",
  "description": "Equilibrium of a body requires both a balance of forces to prevent the body from translating or having accelerated motion along a straight or curved path - and a balance of moments to prevent the body from rotating. This tool calculates support reaction forces for beams and structural frames under static equilibrium conditions.",
  "type": "datatable",
  "components": [
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "## Support Reactions - Equilibrium\n\nEquilibrium of a body requires both a balance of forces to prevent the body from translating or having accelerated motion along a straight or curved path - and a balance of moments to prevent the body from rotating.\n\n### Equilibrium Equations\n\n**Static equilibrium in a three dimensional system:**\n\n- ΣF = ΣFx = ΣFy = ΣFz = 0 (Force equilibrium)\n- ΣM = ΣMx = ΣMy = ΣMz = 0 (Moment equilibrium)\n\n**For two dimensional co-planar systems:**\n\n- ΣF = ΣFx = ΣFy = 0\n- ΣM = ΣMz = 0\n\nWhere:\n- F = force (N, lb)\n- M = moment (Nm, ft·lb)\n- x, y, z = orthogonal axes"
    },
    {
      "type": "calculator",
      "headers": [
        "Beam with Eccentric Load - Example"
      ],
      "inputs": [
        {
          "id": "beam_length",
          "label": "Beam Length",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "m",
          "defaultValue": 6
        },
        {
          "id": "applied_force",
          "label": "Applied Force",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "N",
          "defaultValue": 9000
        },
        {
          "id": "distance_a",
          "label": "Distance from Support 1 to Load",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "m",
          "defaultValue": 4
        }
      ],
      "outputs": [
        {
          "id": "distance_b",
          "label": "Distance from Load to Support 2",
          "formula": "inputs.beam_length - inputs.distance_a",
          "unit": "m"
        },
        {
          "id": "reaction_support2",
          "label": "Reaction Force at Support 2 (R2y)",
          "formula": "(inputs.applied_force * inputs.distance_a) / inputs.beam_length",
          "unit": "N",
          "format": "decimal"
        },
        {
          "id": "reaction_support1",
          "label": "Reaction Force at Support 1 (R1y)",
          "formula": "inputs.applied_force - (inputs.applied_force * inputs.distance_a) / inputs.beam_length",
          "unit": "N",
          "format": "decimal"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "calculator",
      "headers": [
        "Structural Frame - Example"
      ],
      "inputs": [
        {
          "id": "frame_weight",
          "label": "Hanging Weight (F)",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "N",
          "defaultValue": 1000
        },
        {
          "id": "frame_length",
          "label": "Total Frame Length",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "cm",
          "defaultValue": 230
        },
        {
          "id": "distance_to_weight_a",
          "label": "Distance from Point A to Weight",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "cm",
          "defaultValue": 100
        },
        {
          "id": "distance_to_weight_b",
          "label": "Distance from Point B to Weight",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "cm",
          "defaultValue": 130
        },
        {
          "id": "frame_height",
          "label": "Frame Height",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "cm",
          "defaultValue": 80.7
        }
      ],
      "outputs": [
        {
          "id": "reaction_by",
          "label": "Vertical Reaction at B (RBy)",
          "formula": "(inputs.frame_weight * inputs.distance_to_weight_a) / inputs.frame_length",
          "unit": "N",
          "format": "decimal"
        },
        {
          "id": "reaction_ay",
          "label": "Vertical Reaction at A (RAy)",
          "formula": "(inputs.frame_weight * inputs.distance_to_weight_b) / inputs.frame_length",
          "unit": "N",
          "format": "decimal"
        },
        {
          "id": "reaction_bx",
          "label": "Horizontal Reaction at B (RBx)",
          "formula": "((inputs.frame_weight * inputs.distance_to_weight_a) / inputs.frame_length) * inputs.distance_to_weight_b / inputs.frame_height",
          "unit": "N",
          "format": "decimal"
        },
        {
          "id": "reaction_ax",
          "label": "Horizontal Reaction at A (RAx)",
          "formula": "((inputs.frame_weight * inputs.distance_to_weight_a) / inputs.frame_length) * inputs.distance_to_weight_b / inputs.frame_height",
          "unit": "N",
          "format": "decimal"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "datatable",
      "headers": [
        "Load Case",
        "Horizontal Force (N)",
        "Vertical Force (N)",
        "Moment (Nm)"
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          "Beam with Eccentric Load - Support 1",
          "0",
          "3000",
          "0"
        ],
        [
          "Beam with Eccentric Load - Support 2",
          "0",
          "6000",
          "0"
        ],
        [
          "Structural Frame - Support A",
          "700",
          "565",
          "0"
        ],
        [
          "Structural Frame - Support B",
          "700",
          "435",
          "0"
        ]
      ]
    }
  ]
}